{{TAG:0003:0002:}}AHAHAH!{{TAG:0007:0000:1E000000}}{{TAG:0003:0001:}}

TRANSLATION:
{{TAG:0003:0001:}}Yahu{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}} bu yıl çoook yedim{{TAG:0007:0000:1E000000}}{{TAG:0000:0003:0400}}!{{TAG:0000:0003:FFFF}}
Franklin'ın yemekleri acayip
